# v1.2.2:
- Renaming now changes the country's adjective too, so countries like Byzantium rename properly.

# v1.2.1:
- Update for v1.3.10
- Now achievement compatible

# v1.2.0:
- Added a "Show country title" checkbox to the rename dialog. When checked, the new name keeps the country's normal title formatting (for example "Kingdom of Gaul"); when unchecked, the name displays exactly as typed, as before.

